  "cue_count": 59,
  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.32,
      "text": "Three reasons why we should continue using nuclear energy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115759,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003323
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 4.32,
      "end": 7.6,
      "text": "One, nuclear energy saves lives.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115759,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003323
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 7.6,
      "end": 10.72,
      "text": "In 2013, a study conducted by NASA",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115759,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003323
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 10.72,
      "end": 15.44,
      "text": "found that nuclear energy has prevented around 1.8 million deaths.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115759,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003323
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 15.44,
      "end": 18.88,
      "text": "Even if you include the death tolls from Chernobyl and Fukushima,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115759,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003323
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 18.88,
      "end": 23.84,
      "text": "nuclear energy ranks last in death per energy unit produced.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115759,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003323
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 23.84,
      "end": 28.56,
      "text": "While nuclear waste is really toxic, it's usually stored somewhere.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115759,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003323
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 28.56,
      "end": 33.92,
      "text": "While the toxic byproducts of fossil fuels are pumped into the air we breathe every day.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001032
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 33.92,
      "end": 37.28,
      "text": "So, just by reducing the amount of fossil fuels burned,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001032
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 37.28,
      "end": 42.72,
      "text": "countless cases of cancer or lung disease and accidents in coal mines have been avoided.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001032
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 42.72,
      "end": 46.56,
      "text": "If we can choose between lots of dangerous stuff being put into a deep hole",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001032
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 46.56,
      "end": 51.04,
      "text": "and lots and lots and lots of dangerous stuff being pumped into the atmosphere,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001032
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 51.04,
      "end": 53.28,
      "text": "the former seems more logical.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001032
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 53.28,
      "end": 56.32,
      "text": "Nuclear energy feels way more dangerous though.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05947,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001032
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 56.32,
      "end": 61.84,
      "text": "Single catastrophic events burn into our memory while coal and oil kill silently.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 61.84,
      "end": 65.2,
      "text": "It's like the death rate of flying versus driving.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 65.2,
      "end": 66.88,
      "text": "Even in the best case scenario,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 66.88,
      "end": 71.6,
      "text": "it would take at least 40 years to switch to 100% renewable energy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 71.6,
      "end": 74.72,
      "text": "So, for as long as we continue using fossil fuels,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 74.72,
      "end": 79.2,
      "text": "nuclear energy will save way more lives than it destroys.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 79.2,
      "end": 83.52,
      "text": "Two, nuclear energy reduces CO2 emissions.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.081702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000437
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 83.52,
      "end": 87.12,
      "text": "Nuclear energy is arguably way less harmful to the environment",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.092476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005466
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 87.12,
      "end": 91.44,
      "text": "in terms of climate change than fossil fuels, our main source of energy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.092476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005466
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 91.44,
      "end": 96.48,
      "text": "Since 1976, about 64 gigatons of greenhouse gas emissions",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.092476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005466
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 96.48,
      "end": 100.16,
      "text": "have not been pumped out thanks to nuclear energy.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.092476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005466
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 100.16,
      "end": 106.88,
      "text": "And by the mid-21st century, that could amount to an additional 80 to 240 gigatons.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.092476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005466
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 106.88,
      "end": 110.32,
      "text": "Humanity's energy consumption is rising steadily.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.092476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005466
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 110.32,
      "end": 112.4,
      "text": "According to US government projections,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.094665,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 112.4,
      "end": 116.32,
      "text": "China alone will add the equivalent of a new 600 megawatt coal plant",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.094665,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 116.32,
      "end": 119.12,
      "text": "every 10 days for the next 10 years.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.094665,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 119.12,
      "end": 122.48,
      "text": "China already burns 4 billion tons of coal each year.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.094665,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 122.48,
      "end": 126.16,
      "text": "Coal is cheap, relatively abundant and easy to get to.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.094665,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 126.16,
      "end": 129.92,
      "text": "So, it's not likely that humanity will stop using it soon.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.094665,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 129.92,
      "end": 134.16,
      "text": "Nuclear energy might be the only way of dampening the effects of climate change",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.094665,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 134.16,
      "end": 137.84,
      "text": "and preventing a catastrophic man-made global warming.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.094665,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000174
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 137.84,
      "end": 142.48,
      "text": "Compared to the other things we do, nuclear energy is relatively clean.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.077687,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000755
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 142.48,
      "end": 146.08,
      "text": "So, even if it is a good idea to quit nuclear energy long-term,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.077687,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000755
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 146.08,
      "end": 149.12,
      "text": "it might be a good solution for the next 100 years or so",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.077687,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000755
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 149.12,
      "end": 151.12,
      "text": "compared to the alternatives.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.077687,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000755
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 151.12,
      "end": 153.6,
      "text": "Three, new technologies.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.077687,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000755
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 153.6,
      "end": 159.04,
      "text": "Maybe technology will solve the problem of nuclear waste and dangerous power plants.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.077687,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000755
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 159.04,
      "end": 163.76,
      "text": "The nuclear reactors we've used so far are mostly outdated technology",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.077687,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000755
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 163.76,
      "end": 167.12,
      "text": "because nuclear innovation stopped in the 1970s.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.077687,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000755
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 167.12,
      "end": 171.76,
      "text": "There are models like the thorium reactor that could solve the problem altogether.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05415,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00033
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 171.76,
      "end": 175.04,
      "text": "Thorium is abundant, really hard to turn into nuclear weapons,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05415,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00033
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 175.04,
      "end": 179.92,
      "text": "and up to two orders of magnitude less wasteful than current nuclear reactors.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05415,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00033
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 179.92,
      "end": 184.0,
      "text": "The waste material might also be only dangerous for a few hundred years",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05415,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00033
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 184.0,
      "end": 186.48,
      "text": "in contrast to a couple of thousand years.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05415,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00033
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 186.48,
      "end": 190.24,
      "text": "One ton of thorium is estimated to provide the same amount of energy",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05415,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00033
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 190.24,
      "end": 194.8,
      "text": "as 200 tons of uranium or 3.5 million tons of coal.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.05415,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00033
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 194.8,
      "end": 199.68,
      "text": "So, while we cannot know for sure if alternative nuclear technology will keep its promises,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074055,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000191
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 199.68,
      "end": 203.12,
      "text": "shouldn't we at least do more research before we forgo an opportunity",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074055,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000191
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 203.12,
      "end": 205.76,
      "text": "to solve lots of humanity's current problems?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074055,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000191
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 205.76,
      "end": 209.28,
      "text": "It might not be an easy challenge, but that hasn't stopped us before.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074055,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000191
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 210.08,
      "end": 212.4,
      "text": "So, should we use nuclear energy?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074055,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000191
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 213.12,
      "end": 215.76,
      "text": "There are risks involved in any great human endeavor,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074055,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000191
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 215.76,
      "end": 219.28,
      "text": "and we have to make an informed decision rather than rely on gut feeling.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074055,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000191
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 220.24,
      "end": 222.32,
      "text": "If you want to hear the other side of the argument,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074055,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000191
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 222.32,
      "end": 226.24,
      "text": "or a short introduction to nuclear energy, click here.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148158,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.568848
    }
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-11-12T19:16:11+0800"
}
